# single pincell

title 'Single pincell' /

nrow    1    / number of rows of rods along one edge
ppitch  1.26 / rod pitch

# Material List:  (edit to top of mesh file)
matname  2  Fuel
matcool  1    / coolant material number

# define pin radii and material numbers by ring
pinrad A 0.26 0.53  /
pinmat A  2    2   /

# map of pin types
rodmap
  A /

